{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_74_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_74","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，晉殺其大夫丕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_74_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_74","textTraditional":"二、夏，公及夫人姜氏會齊侯于陽穀。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_74_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_74","textTraditional":"三、秋八月大雩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_74_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_74","textTraditional":"四、冬，楚人伐黃。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}